     "titulo": "Calls and messages",
     "texto": [
      "**Oddzwonię** means «I'll call you back». The simple future of a perfective verb presents the action as a whole.",
      "The second-person pronoun appears in forms like **cię** («you»); word order can vary depending on emphasis."
